{"availability":"available","full":"Ircama/PT-P300BT","name":"PT-P300BT","description":"Printing to a Brother P-Touch Cube PT-P300BT label printer from a computer or a browser","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":91,"forks":20,"created":"2024-09-21T12:06:38Z","updated":"2026-09-16T08:03:56Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ircama.github.io/PT-P300BT","topics":["brother","label","p-touch","print","pt-300bt"],"demo":"https://ircama.github.io/PT-P300BT","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:50.730Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:50.730Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:50.730Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T00:25:50.730Z","stars":91,"forks":20}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Web-based and Python-based label printing utility designed for Brother PT-P300BT thermal label printers. This program creates custom labels with text, images, and advanced formatting options, automatically optimizing content to fit within the printer's specifications.","It supports any TrueType and OpenType font, automatically selects the maximum font size to fit the printable area of the tape. Text strings including characters which do not overshoot) below the baseline) (e.g., uppercase letters) are automatically printed with a bigger font. In addition, the program calculates the length of the printed tape and the printing time, and supports emojis and images.","The Brother P-touch Cube PT-P300BT labelling machine is intended to be controlled from the official Brother P-touch Design&Print 2 app for Android and iOS devices."],"features":["Unicode Support: Full UTF-8 character support with optional Unicode escape sequences","Custom Fonts: Support for TrueType (.ttf) and OpenType (.otf) fonts","Automatic Font Sizing: Intelligent font size optimization to fit the printable area","Multiline Text: Support for multi-line labels with configurable line spacing","Text Styling: Configurable fill colors, s